// vnkey_en.loc - the texts of VnKey's screens in English (vnkey_en.rsc, the Language
// setting). UTF-8: vnkey.rss says CHARACTER_SET UTF8. Every text here is also in
// vnkey_vi.loc, under the same name and with the same %d / %S in the same order.

